OL,3,GNEWSACounty records lowest number
OL,4,Asmoking in pregnancy
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecord low numbers of women are now
OL,7,Fsmoking during pregnancy, say
OL,8,FShropshire health leaders.
OL,10,FA meeting this week is set to be told
OL,11,Fthe figures for smoking at the time of
OL,12,Fdelivery are now 4.8%, well below the
OL,13,Fgovernment's 6% target and the lowest
OL,14,Ffigure recorded locally.
OL,16,FChiefs at the Shrewsbury and Telford
OL,17,FHospital NHS Trust (SaTH) say the
OL,18,Flatest statistics "reflect the
OL,19,Fdedication of the specialist maternity
OL,20,Fteam to support women to give up
OL,21,Fsmoking."
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
